<title>Overview of gateway exam</title>
  <p>The gateway exam consists of 10 problems.  Each problem is on its own page.  You can switch pages with the Previous and Next buttons.</p>

  <p>This practice gateway exam is nearly identical to the actual gateway exam.  For each attempt, problems are randomly selected from a pool of questions.  The actual gateway exam, however, will not give you the solution or indicate whether or not your response is correct.</p>

  <p>When you are done, click the Finish Assessment button.</p>
 